WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:06.670
One Two Three Four Fly{XXX: I was hoping not to have to listen to this again...}

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:06.670
One Two Three Four Fly

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.920
Fly

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.840
Fly

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:12.590
And cut!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.690
Your next concert has already sold out,

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.710
and you're getting requests for encore performances... {追加公演 refers to a performance given despite not being initially scheduled. Basically, the musician is so popular that they have to do even more performances in addition to their regular tour to please their numerous fans. I didn't translate it literally because I felt the line was more about emphasizing that Makoto is in the height of her popularity rather than saying she'd be having more work.}

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.020
Makoto?

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.600
Should I...

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.180
really keep singing?

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.540
This whole time, I was singing to find the princess,

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.640
but my music made no difference in the end.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.890
That's not true!

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.320
It wasn't just for the princess.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.120
What about all of your fans?

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.540
Every one of them enjoys your songs.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.490
Cure Ace...

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.310
She was strong.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:05.730
I can't imagine what we would have done without her assistance.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:10.280
But Sword was the only Precure left in Trump Kingdom.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:11.850
In that case...

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:16.760
who <i>was</i> she?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:25.370
Well, she looked younger than us outside of her transformation.

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:27.010
Probably a third grade—

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.240
<i>Fourth</i> grader.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.710
Oh, hello there, Cure Ace.

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:33.500
Hello.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.180
And my name is Madoka Aguri.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:39.020
{OP}

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.210
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.590
Every day it sparkles

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:56.300
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:03.180
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:08.840
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:14.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:19.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:25.620
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:34.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.560
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:44.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:48.070
is our promise between girls

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:54.110
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:54.150 --> 00:03:00.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.990
Shocker!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.990
Shocker!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:14.780
Ai!

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:20.250
You're wooking cute today!

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.380
Back to you all...

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.320
Yes?

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.880
What is this?

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:31.050
Sebastian's signature peach roll cake.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.930
Please, help yourself.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:37.530
Then I shall.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.100
A-Are you okay?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.800
It's scrumptious!

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.900
The sponginess of the cake shows it was baked to perfection!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.550
The fresh cream is rich, but not overpowering!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.520
The ripe peaches are luxuriantly scattered throughout!

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:02.520
It's all held gently together, and tastes of the first day of summer!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.950
It's truly...

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.060
a harmony of love!

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.050
Outstanding.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.600
You can sure tell a lot from a single bite, huh.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.840
You must be a connoisseur of sweets, Aguri!

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:19.440
Your work could put the most skilled bakers to shame!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:24.910
I could feel the love you have for delighting the eater! Bravo!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.080
You honor me.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:32.950
What's more, you gracefully accept a sudden visitor with no reservations.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.850
Truly a professional butler!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.430
Compared to that...

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.930
are you truly a professional?

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:44.370
I listened to your singing on TV yesterday.

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:47.540
To be honest, I was disappointed.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:51.010
Hey, hold on!

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:54.250
Makopi's a super-popular singer!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.610
Even critics recognize her talent! {literally, she's a "recognized singer" in the sense that a scientist or scholar might have his knowledge or abilities recognized by an international organization. But no such organization exists for idolatry, I assume, and the JP line makes no mention of "critics," so I assume it's just generally accepted by everyone that she has legit skillz. Saying critics approve of her gets the message across well enough, though.}

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:01.520
She's the number one singer in Trump Kingdom!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.690
I care not what the public thinks of her.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:08.290
All I know is that I did not feel an ounce of love from the performance I saw.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.220
Instead, I felt...

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:12.760
uncertainty.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:21.340
A true pro would be ashamed to sing so half-heartedly.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.770
Makopi's trying whole-heartedly!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.350
She's a singer <i>and</i> a Precure!

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.750
She's an amateur at that as well!

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.820
Had I not saved you all before,

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:33.240
those Selfishes would have defeated you.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.590
Am I wrong?

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:36.710
Well...

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:40.490
You girls are amateurish in every way.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:45.820
You haven't the slightest chance of victory against King Selfish as you are now.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.390
Thank you for the cake.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.390
I will take my leave for today.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.540
Huh? Wait!

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:56.170
Cure Ace!

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:08.960
Makopi, I'm really excited for your next concert!

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:12.690
I'm a failure of a pro...

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:16.880
Cure Ace was right.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:19.530
I've been so uncertain lately.

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:24.320
I worry that there's no point in singing now that we've found the princess.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:28.030
And I know that I shouldn't sing with my heart so clouded.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.990
I'm going to quit singing.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.750
I'll announce my retirement at my next concert.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.790
Hold on, Makopi!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.380
You can't quit!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.450
I've made my choice.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.780
I won't sing anymore.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.680
And that's final!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.490
Is she serious?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:52.360
She can't do it!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:56.570
She absolutely positively can't quit singing!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.710
Um, are you really doing this?

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.410
Of course!

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.380
Operation "Make Her Want to Sing" is a go!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.380
Makopi...

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.970
Makopi, you must not resign from singing.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.190
You absolutely positively cann—

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.140
Mana, what are you doing?

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.840
Well, uh...

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:28.110
I figured you'd rethink your decision if the princess stopped you...

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.000
What gave me away?

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.200
The princess doesn't call me "Makopi."

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.320
My fatal flaw!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:37.910
No, I think you had plenty.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:50.810
The Yotsuba Philharmonic Orchestra shall provide live music!

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.240
Now, could you please sing?

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.290
I told you I'm not singing!

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:01.730
So, Operation "Live Band" failed too?

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:05.690
I thought the music would make her subconsciously want to sing...

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.670
No, it just makes it harder to.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:15.080
I have to get in shape to beat the Selfish!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:23.730
GoOOo to SLEeeEp, gOooO to sLeEEep,

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:26.680
ooOOn MoOommy's...

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:31.250
Oh, what should I do, Ai?

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.240
Makopi!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:37.440
Ai just started crying.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.970
Could you sing a lullaby?

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:47.190
I won't sing anymore.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.580
I already told you.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:51.930
But why?

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.120
Everyone wants to hear you sing!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.340
There are other singers out there.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.550
But wasn't it fun, Makopi?

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:02.970
You always look like you're enjoying yourself when you sing.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:07.950
And somehow, seeing you like that warms my heart, and I have fun...

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:09.800
We don't have time for fun. {Wow, total nofunallowed.jpg}

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.970
And I don't have time for singing.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.740
Do those girls realize they're supposed to be Precures?

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:21.710
Everyone just wants you to keep singing.

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:24.850
Does that include you, Davi?

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:27.960
I want you to do what you want to do.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.650
I'll be with you a hundred percent!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.550
Now, goal! {Not literal, but emphasizes that he doesn't give a shit about the rules.}

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.830
Tastes awful.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.680
'Cause you're not supposed to eat it.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:53.310
What hick doesn't know what bowling is?

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.500
Who says we don't know?

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.640
Now be a dear and go find the princess at once!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:03.280
Since when do you order <i>us</i> around?!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:06.590
Since our orders came from King Selfish!

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:11.350
Very well. We'll go.

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:13.760
I'll remember this!

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:22.940
Intriguing...

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.790
Huh? Makopi isn't here yet?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:47.380
She isn't answering her phone.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:50.300
The concert is starting soon!

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:50.900
Sebastian!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:51.760
On it.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:52.870
Let's search too!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:03.640
Makoto, it's time for the concert.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.610
Yeah, I should go.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:09.240
I'll go, and I'll announce...

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:12.260
my retirement.

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:16.410
Is there some trouble backstage?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.330
I've got to get behind those scenes!

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:23.570
No, no, that'd be against the rules.

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.670
Aw, just get in.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.770
I shall grant your desire!

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.750
Go berserk!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.950
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.260
Hello, everyone!

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:51.980
Your host for tonight shall be yours truly, and...

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:56.290
Me, Selfish!

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.450
You all feelin' selfish tonight?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.970
Yeah!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:05.170
Hm, tough crowd.

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:05.960
Show's over!

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:09.130
Show's over!

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:09.940
Let's go!

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.710
Charles!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.650
Precure Love Link!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:17.690
L-O-V-E!

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.250
L-O-V-E!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.090
L-O-V-E!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.110
L-O-V-E!

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:37.540
Brimming with love,

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.730
Cure Heart!

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.220
The light of wisdom,

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.500
Cure Diamond!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.630
The warmth of the sun,

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:52.970
Cure Rosetta!

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.030
Oh poor mic who has lost its love, {There's no way Mana could be psychic enough to know it's a girl here, so I'll just dodge the issue.}

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:59.190
I, Cure Heart,

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.440
will make your heart race once more!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.010
There you are, Precures.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.360
Investigate! {Obviously using 突撃 in the literal sense, but it's a reference to her reporter nature, so it can't be helped.}

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.400
This is Makopi's stage!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.780
Seeeeeelf!

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.750
It's a Selfish!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.250
Girls!

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:21.380
Precure behind-the-scenes interview!

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:25.060
Are you dating anyone?

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:25.980
Huh?

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:29.120
What did you get on your last test?

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.110
That has nothing to do with our fight!

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:34.950
How much money do you have?

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.070
Hmm...

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:37.600
I've never counted.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:40.980
Please answer honestly!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.870
What is this, an interrogation?

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:45.910
Quite the invasion of privacy!

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.660
But this Selfish is strong!

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:52.040
Girls!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.860
Ow...

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.680
Ai, why are you...

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:58.560
Here.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.480
A Lovies?

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.450
Put that in me!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.470
Dibbity dobbity Davi!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.020
Kyupirapa kyupirapa!

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:14.420
A mirror?

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:16.600
Sword.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.330
Princess! You've awakened?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.510
No, not yet.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:27.010
I speak to you now through Ai's powers.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.350
I do not have long.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:36.010
Cure Sword, you sang for me even in this world, did you not?

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:40.580
Both your songs and your feelings touched my heart.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.400
Is that true?

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:47.560
I may be unable to move or speak,

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:51.120
but something gave me hope on the brink of despair.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.730
Sword, that was your singing.

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:59.280
Hearing your songs warmed my heart and brought me cheer.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.020
Thank you so much.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.470
Princess...

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:08.000
I may not be able to awaken yet,

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:11.550
but I'll be fine with Jonathan by my side.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.990
So I ask you, please, sing for your own sake.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.490
My own... sake?

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:24.110
Enjoy it as you once did.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.440
Your happiness gives me joy, too.

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.950
Please sing, Cure Sword.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:43.620
Mana and the princess told you the same thing!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:49.420
Mana, the princess, and even I all love your songs!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.570
We want to hear you sing with joy!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.610
I...

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.210
want to sing.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.620
I'm with you a hundred percent!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.310
Thank you...

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.790
It seems it's curtains for you Precures.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.930
It's not over yet! {"Not until the fat lady sings" would be fun to use if it even remotely fit. :V}

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.280
We shall never give in!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:28.800
We'll never, ever let you ruin Makopi's concert!

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:35.280
Sword!

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:37.740
You girls have done so much...

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.220
Thank you.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:45.490
Why do you sing despite being a Precure?

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:48.530
Can you call yourself a Precure?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.590
I'm a singing Precure!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.180
What could singing possibly accomplish?

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:58.830
It makes no difference in the end!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:02.930
It might make no difference, and it might be pointless,

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.060
but... it's fun!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.830
It makes me happy!

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:13.790
I love to sing, so I'll keep singing!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:16.260
I love your singing, too!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.960
Singing because you love singing?

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.990
Sounds rather selfish to me.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:22.760
Maybe.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:28.110
But there are people who support me regardless.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:33.410
So for their sake, and my own, I'll keep singing!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:46.010
It seems your love has awakened, Cure Sword.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.830
The Precure's power is born from love.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:55.370
Pursuing a passion with all your heart is love as well.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:56.820
Love...

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.150
Your uncertainty hindered the power of your love,

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:03.060
but you've overcome your troubles,

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:07.170
and unlocked a new power with an even deeper love!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.200
Well done.

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:12.100
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:13.720
First! {Yep, she says hitotsu. It can't be helped.}

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:15.340
Love is meant to be given!

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:20.490
Your songs give love to the world.

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:25.740
Please, continue to let the world listen to your songs of love!

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:26.600
Sure.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.380
Ai, let's go!

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:34.200
Precure Dress Up!

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:36.630
Kyupirappa!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.320
Love's trump card,

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:25.890
Cure Ace!

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.220
Beauty is the mark of the righteous!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.520
With a single wink,

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:37.110
I shall pierce your heart!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.960
What's your favorite sna—

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.240
Hey!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.410
I'm the star here!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.740
I will not be upstaged!

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:49.120
Your lukewarm show need not go on.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.480
Your performance has no love!

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:15.460
Beautify!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.960
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:28.240
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.580
Ace Shot!

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:31.350
Bang!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.800
I'm stuck-fish!

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:39.960
Sword, now is your chance!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.480
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.490
Selfiiiiish!

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.170
Love love loooove!

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:04.330
Not bad.

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:06.250
This might be fun.

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:16.360
Makopi really is amazing!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:20.090
Her songs can make so many people smile!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.140
They can.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:24.340
And smiles make Egogy disappear.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:29.300
Makopi's songs might be saving the world!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.210
Her singing is overflowing with love.

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.900
Bravo!

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:44.090
I love to sing!

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:49.560
Singing makes me feel ecstatic, happy, and blessed!

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.780
I want you all to feel the same way.

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:57.540
So I'll keep singing!

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:04.920
{ED}

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:08.370
Breaking news!

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:11.510
Alice's butler created an artificial Commune!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:12.710
Artificial Commune?

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:16.150
It's an amazing invention that turns anyone into a Precure!

00:22:16.150 --> 00:22:17.650
My name is Cure Sebastian.

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:20.350
I am here to be of service to Madam.

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:21.320
Wow!

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:22.690
He really transformed!

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:25.520
Huh? Another heroine shows up like a bolt from the blue?

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:26.220
Who's she?

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:28.390
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:28.460
A Gorgeous Transformation!

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:28.460
A Gorgeous Transformation!

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:31.430
A Gorgeous Transformation!

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:31.430
A Gorgeous Transformation!

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:33.630
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
